iently located just down the hall and an assigned parking stall at the rear. Recent building upgrades include new windows, patio doors, balconies, hallways, lighting, boiler, laundry facilities, sidewalks and parkade. Located close to public transit, downtown, Grant MacEwan, NAIT, U of A, shopping, restaurants, cafés, parks and trails. Perfect for first-time buyers, students, professionals or investors! Ideal for those seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle with an excellent location and easy access to everything Edmonton has to offer! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$159,900"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","1"],["Bathrooms","1"],["Living area","721 sq ft"],["Lot size","620 sq ft"],["Year built","1971"],["Condo fee","$483 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Inglewood"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5M0K4"],["MLS® number","E4508997"],["Listed","September 16, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Refrigerator, Stove, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Baseboard heaters"],["Parking","Stall"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Den","Upper Level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level",""]],"courtesy":"Joseph Yisak, MaxWell Devonshire Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"inglewood","area":"northwest-edmonton"}